$ Shallow-water propagation over a submerged bar with SPB triads
$
$ Added for path coverage: SPB was the last triad formulation that no deck in
$ the repository selected, so SWFTIM's SPB branch was never reached by the
$ bounds-checked build.
PROJECT 'TRIAD_SPB' '001'
SET CARTESIAN
MODE STATIONARY ONEDIMENSIONAL
COORDINATES CARTESIAN

CGRID REGULAR 0.0 0.0 0.0 30.0 0.0 300 0 &
      SECTOR -10.0 10.0 20 0.10 2.0 31
INPGRID BOTTOM REGULAR 0.0 0.0 0.0 30 0 1.0 1.0
READINP BOTTOM 1.0 'bottom.bot' 1 0 FREE

BOUND SHAPESPEC JONSWAP 3.3 PEAK DSPR DEGREES
BOUNDSPEC SIDE WEST CONSTANT PAR 0.06 2.0 0.0 2.0

GEN3 WESTH
OFF WINDGROWTH
OFF WCAPPING
OFF QUADRUPLET
TRIAD SPB

POINTS 'GAUGES' 2.0 0.0 10.0 0.0 15.0 0.0 18.0 0.0 &
         25.0 0.0 30.0 0.0
TABLE 'GAUGES' HEADER 'triad_spb.tbl' XP DEPTH HSIGN TM01 RTP REDTRIAD REDQUAD
SPECOUT 'GAUGES' SPEC1D ABS 'triad_spb.spc'
TEST 1 0 POINTS XY 15.0 0.0 S1D 'triad_spb_sources.spc'

COMPUTE
STOP
